<title>FINLAND: TUOMO HALONEN SWINGS TO 6-MTH PROFIT.</title>
<headline>TUOMO HALONEN SWINGS TO 6-MTH PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31-</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, taxes   1.6 vs 0.6 loss</p>
<p> Net sales				    56.9 vs 51.6</p>
<p> Operating profit			    4.5 vs 2.5</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     37.3 vs 34.8</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish engineering group is Tuomo</p>
<p>Halonen Oy. It said in a statement with the six-month results it</p>
<p>will change its name to Elecster Oy in the second half of the</p>
<p>financial year.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 0 6805 0245</p>
</text>
